commit bc4f64218ea8330306b4d50937fbbf7759bbff1b
Author: Nicholas Hemsley <nick.hems@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Jan 30 14:26:00 2026 +0800

    feat(agent_ui): Show model selector when holding Ctrl key
    
    - Add modal chooser that displays when Ctrl is held down
    - Shows existing model selector with MRU models at the top
    - Automatically closes when Ctrl is released without selection
    - Track state to only close picker if it was opened by Ctrl hold
    - Support both legacy model_selector and config_options_view paths
    - Add is_deployed() method to AcpModelSelectorPopover
    - Add is_category_picker_open() method to ConfigOptionsView
    
    Closes: zed-vb7.3

